{"n":20,"title":"How much is it?!","blurb":"Просить товар и понимать цены","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"How much is it?!","sub":"","html":"<p>Покупки без паники: аптеки, гаджеты и чашка кофе за £5.75.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Просить что-то в магазине</li><li>Спрашивать и понимать цены</li><li>Использовать how much и how many</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Что вы покупаете каждую неделю?","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"coffee"},{"label":"apples"},{"label":"water"},{"label":"bread"},{"label":"a newspaper"},{"label":"nothing"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"shop","pos":"","ru":"магазин","kk":"дүкен","def":"I work in a small shop.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/5042d1466675.mp3"},{"en":"buy","pos":"","ru":"покупать","kk":"сатып алу","def":"Could you buy me some apples?","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/a066f070178f.mp3"},{"en":"price","pos":"","ru":"цена","kk":"баға","def":"What's the price?","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/2097c33723b6.mp3"},{"en":"customer","pos":"","ru":"покупатель","kk":"сатып алушы","def":"The customer asks for an umbrella.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/b39f008e318e.mp3"},{"en":"size","pos":"","ru":"размер","kk":"өлшем","def":"What size — small or large?","img":"/course/a0/img/l20-size.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/89368e1d6801.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"money","pos":"","ru":"деньги","kk":"ақша","def":"Here's some money.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/c95259de1fd7.mp3"},{"en":"pound","pos":"","ru":"фунт","kk":"фунт","def":"It's 96 pounds.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/dad7d5e0fd94.mp3"},{"en":"euro","pos":"","ru":"евро","kk":"еуро","def":"That's 6 euros 49.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/0eb8b4484399.mp3"},{"en":"cheap","pos":"","ru":"дешёвый","kk":"арзан","def":"Motorbikes are very cheap here.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/fb8df41a16b4.mp3"},{"en":"expensive","pos":"","ru":"дорогой","kk":"қымбат","def":"It's a very expensive café.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/e0d587ce038c.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"match","title":"Соедините пары и противоположности.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"cheap","right":"expensive"},{"left":"buy","right":"sell"},{"left":"customer","right":"shop assistant"},{"left":"small","right":"large"}],"options":["expensive","large","shop assistant","sell"]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два вопроса.","sub":"Один — про цену, другой — про количество.","items":[{"text":"How much is this tablet?","src":null},{"text":"How many apples would you like?","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"how much / how many","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Для чего</th><th>Ответ</th></tr><tr><td>How much is it?</td><td>the price</td><td>It's £75.</td></tr><tr><td>How much water?</td><td>things you can't count</td><td>Two bottles.</td></tr><tr><td>How many apples?</td><td>things you can count</td><td>Six, please.</td></tr><tr><td>How much are these?</td><td>the price, plural</td><td>They're $24.90.</td></tr></table><p><b>How much</b> — про цену: How much <b>is</b> it? / How much <b>are</b> they?</p><p><b>How many</b> — про количество исчисляемых.</p><p>С water, milk, money — <b>how much</b>, а не how many.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"cols","title":"how much или how many?","sub":"","columns":["how much","how many"],"items":[{"text":"sizes","col":1},{"text":"apples","col":1},{"text":"coffee","col":0},{"text":"umbrellas","col":1},{"text":"water","col":0},{"text":"money","col":0}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"some / any в магазине","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Предложение</th><th>Кто говорит</th></tr><tr><td>?</td><td>Do you have any umbrellas?</td><td>the customer</td></tr><tr><td>–</td><td>We don't have any today.</td><td>the shop assistant</td></tr><tr><td>+</td><td>I'd like some apples, please.</td><td>the customer</td></tr><tr><td>?</td><td>Could you buy me some apples?</td><td>a polite request</td></tr></table><p>В вопросах и отрицаниях — <b>any</b>: Do you have <b>any</b>…?</p><p>В просьбах и предложениях — <b>some</b>: I'd like <b>some</b> apples.</p><p><b>Could you…?</b> — особенно вежливая просьба.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">Цены: £5.75 = five pounds seventy-five.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["Do you have any umbrellas?","How much is this tablet?","It's 75 pounds.","How many would you like?","I'd like some apples, please.","That's six euros forty-nine."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ apples would you like?","options":["How much","How many","How often"],"keep":false,"answer":"How many","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ is this phone?","options":["How many","How often","How much"],"keep":false,"answer":"How much","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ water do you drink?","options":["How much","How many","How old"],"keep":false,"answer":"How much","why":"Воду не считают → how much.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Do you have","after":"umbrellas?","answers":["any"],"bank":["any","some","a"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I'd like","after":"apples, please.","answers":["some"],"bank":["any","some","much"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"We don't have","after":"today.","answers":["any"],"bank":["any","some","many of"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Can I help you?","options":["No, thanks. Just looking.","Yes, I am.","No, I don't."],"keep":false,"answer":"No, thanks. Just looking.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— How much is this tablet?","options":["Six, please.","It's £75.","Yes, please."],"keep":false,"answer":"It's £75.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Is that everything?","options":["No, I need vitamins, too.","No, I'm not.","Yes, I like."],"keep":false,"answer":"No, I need vitamins, too.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["phone?","is","this","How","much"],"answer":"How much is this phone?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["any","Do","umbrellas?","you","have"],"answer":"Do you have any umbrellas?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["apples?","buy","you","Could","me","some"],"answer":"Could you buy me some apples?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["How","many","is","this","tablet?"],"bad":1,"answer":"How much is this tablet?","why":"Про цену — how much."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Do","you","have","some","umbrellas?"],"bad":3,"answer":"Do you have any umbrellas?","why":"В вопросе — any."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["How","much","apples","would","you","like?"],"bad":1,"an