p>Hi! I'm Ali. I work in a small shop in the centre.</p><p>People ask me: How much is this? How many do you want?</p><p>Our coffee is cheap — two euros. The cakes are expensive.</p><p>We don't have any umbrellas today. Sorry!</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"The coffee in Ali's shop is cheap.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ali</p><p>Hi! I'm Ali. I work in a small shop in the centre.</p><p>People ask me: How much is this? How many do you want?</p><p>Our coffee is cheap — two euros. The cakes are expensive.</p><p>We don't have any umbrellas today. Sorry!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"They have umbrellas today.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ali</p><p>Hi! I'm Ali. I work in a small shop in the centre.</p><p>People ask me: How much is this? How many do you want?</p><p>Our coffee is cheap — two euros. The cakes are expensive.</p><p>We don't have any umbrellas today. Sorry!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"They don't have","after":"umbrellas today.","answers":["any"],"bank":["any","much","some"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ali</p><p>Hi! I'm Ali. I work in a small shop in the centre.</p><p>People ask me: How much is this? How many do you want?</p><p>Our coffee is cheap — two euros. The cakes are expensive.</p><p>We don't have any umbrellas today. Sorry!</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите короткий диалог в магазине.","sub":"Попросите что-то, затем спросите цену.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>— Do you have any ___ ?</li><li>— How much ___ ?</li><li>— OK. I'll take it.</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">Do you have any</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">How much is 